  + [dictated_text] is "I was just wondering about the name Cantor, and if it's still so fitted for my purposes. it's barely been 2 days since I gave it that name, but now I wonder about Shaliach as a more fitting name. at first, I was thinking of it performing the service of reciting the record, as is the duty of a Cantor to recite the reading in Shul, but this also represents the responsibility to perform the duty of applying that shape in use... Cantor is the body of the fast-twitch working SOP contract system."

